* Parts: 2N3819, 2N5457, 2SJ74, 2SK170, J310
*

*------------------------------------------------------------------------------
* 2N3819
* RF/general purpose N-JFET
* Source: vendor/interfet-jfet/upstream/interfet-standard.jft:778
*------------------------------------------------------------------------------
.MODEL 2N3819 NJF VTO=-3.59 BETA=856u LAMBDA=24.1m CGS=3.58p CGD=3.58p PB=3.99 IS=95.6f MFG=InterFET

*------------------------------------------------------------------------------
* 2N5457
* General purpose N-JFET
* Source: vendor/interfet-jfet/upstream/interfet-standard.jft:789
*------------------------------------------------------------------------------
.MODEL 2N5457 NJF VTO=-1.25 BETA=1.04m LAMBDA=30.8m CGS=3.58p CGD=3.58p PB=3.99 IS=95.6f MFG=InterFET

